## 4. `web/idempotency/**`

**IdempotencyService 公共 API（精确）**：
```java
public BeginOutcome begin(String principalType, String principalId, String operation,
                          String idempotencyKey, String payloadHash)                       // 独立短事务
public void completeSuccess(IdempotencyHandle handle, String resourceType, UUID resourceId,
                            Map<String, Object> resultSummary)                              // 业务事务内
public void completeRejected(IdempotencyHandle handle, ErrorCode code, int httpStatus,
                             String message, boolean retryable, Map<String, Object> details) // 业务事务内
public static ApiException replayedRejection(BeginOutcome.ReplayRejected replay)
```
`IdempotencyHandle = record(UUID requestId, long attemptRevision)`。`BeginOutcome` 为 sealed：`NewAttempt(IdempotencyHandle handle)` / `ReplaySucceeded(String resourceType, UUID resourceId, JsonNode resultSummary)` / `ReplayRejected(String code, String message, boolean retryable, JsonNode details)`。

**T13 写列**（V1:27-53）：`id`（客户端生 uuid）、`principal_type, principal_id, operation, idempotency_key, payload_hash, status='processing', lease_until, attempt_revision=1`；unique `uq_idem_principal(principal_type,principal_id,operation,idempotency_key)`；`completeSuccess` 写 `status='succeeded', resource_type, resource_id, result_summary, lease_until=NULL`；`completeRejected` 写 `status='rejected', result_summary`；二者 `WHERE id AND attempt_revision = ? AND status='processing'`，0 行 → `StaleAttemptException`（业务事务回滚）。冲突分支：payload_hash 不同 → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONTENT_CONFLICT；succeeded → ReplaySucceeded（只定位不重做）；rejected → ReplayRejected；processing 且租约存活 → `ApiException.requestInProgress(wait)`（409 + Retry-After 头 + details.retryAfterSeconds）；租约过期 → 条件 `UPDATE attempt_revision=attempt_revision+1` 接管。**不按短 TTL 删记录**。

**`ensureSchemaVersion(JsonNode summary)`**（package-private static）：顶层非对象 → 400 INVALID_INPUT；缺 `schema_version` → 服务端注入整数 1；存在但非整数 → 400 INVALID_INPUT（绝不静默改写）。边界由 `SchemaVersionBoundaryTest` 锁定，DB CHECK `ck_idem_result_summary_schema` 类型加固。

**SystemEchoController 逐字用法** —— GET 可见性路径（系统.244-267，三要素 owner 判定 + 统一 404）：
```java
@GetMapping("/{jobId}")
public SuccessEnvelope get(@PathVariable("jobId") UUID jobId, PrincipalContext principal, HttpServletRequest request) {
    var rows = jdbc.query("SELECT id, job_type, owner_type, owner_id, status, attempt_count,"
            + " lease_revision, finished_at, last_error::text AS last_error FROM async_jobs WHERE id = ?",
            ... new EchoJobViewData(... String.valueOf(rs.getLong("attempt_count")),
                    String.valueOf(rs.getLong("lease_revision")), ..., projectError(rs.getString("last_error"))) ...);
    if (rows.isEmpty() || !creatorOwns(rows.get(0), principal)) {
        throw notVisible();   // ApiException(RESOURCE_NOT_VISIBLE, "job not visible")
    }
    return envelopes.ok(request, rows.get(0).view());
}
```
`creatorOwns` = `JOB_TYPE.equals(row.jobType()) && creatorOwnerType(principal).equals(row.ownerType()) && ownerId != null && ownerId.equals(row.ownerId())`，其中 `creatorOwnerType` = APP→"app_account"/GIMBAL→"gimbal"，`creatorOwnerId` = accountUuid/gimbalUuid（**installation 不进 owner_id**，RV-5）。

POST dedup 路径（系统.219-241，**同事务入队 + T13 complete + RV-7 门禁**）：
```java
EnqueueOutcome outcome = txTemplate.execute(status -> {
    JobEnqueuer.JobEnqueueResult r = jobEnqueuer.enqueue(JOB_TYPE, ownerType, ownerId, 0, payload, dedupKey);
    if (!ownsRow(r.jobId(), principal)) {
